   of urbanization, proposing a dynamical innovation diffusion model with
   fuzzy coefficient, and uses the shifting rate of people from rural areas
   stepping into urban areas to show the process of urbanization. The
   numerical simulation shows the diffusion process for telephones in China
   with Genetic Algorithms and this model is effective to show the process
   of innovation diffusion with the condition of urbanization process.},
